      "type": "quote",
      "label": "Everything can be taken from a person but one thing: the las",
      "readingLevel": "analytical",
      "content": "Everything can be taken from a person but one thing: the last of the human freedoms \u2014 to choose one's own attitude in any given set of circumstances, to choose one's own way.",
      "parentId": "mans-search-for-meaning:topic:decisions"
    },
    {
