      "type": "quote",
      "label": "\u201cHe who has a why to live for can bear with almost any how.\u201d",
      "readingLevel": "analytical",
      "content": "\u201cHe who has a why to live for can bear with almost any how.\u201d \u2014 Nietzsche, a line Frankl returns to again and again.",
      "parentId": "mans-search-for-meaning:topic:decisions"
    },
