    },
    {
      "id": "mans-search-for-meaning:quote:fear-1",
      "type": "quote",
      "label": "Fear of a fate can help bring that fate about. An anxious an",
      "readingLevel": "analytical",
      "content": "Fear of a fate can help bring that fate about. An anxious anticipation of what is dreaded tends to make the dreaded thing more likely \u2014 the seed of what logotherapy later named anticipatory anxiety.",
      "parentId": "mans-search-for-meaning:topic:fear"
    },
