      "type": "quote",
      "label": "Phase 1 \u2014 Delusion of reprieve: the condemned man, immediate",
      "readingLevel": "analytical",
      "content": "Phase 1 \u2014 Delusion of reprieve: the condemned man, immediately before his execution, gets the illusion that he may be reprieved at the last minute.",
